{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++11 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++11 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nconst int MAX_NODES = 6010, INF = 0x3f3f3f3f;\nint n, m, k, c, d, edge_count, total_cost, arrival_times[6010], from_node[6010], to_node[6010];\nint head[6010], prev_edge[6010], dist[6010], in_queue[6010];\nqueue<int> q;\nstruct Edge { int dest, capacity, weight, next; } edges[2000010];\n\nint encode(int time, int vertex) { return time * n + vertex; }\n\nvoid insert_edge(int src, int dst, int cap, int cost) {\n    edges[edge_count] = {dst, cap, cost, head[src]};\n    head[src] = edge_count++;\n    edges[edge_count] = {src, 0, -cost, head[dst]};\n    head[dst] = edge_count++;\n}\n\nbool find_shortest_path(int source, int sink) {\n    fill(dist, dist + MAX_NODES, INF);\n    q.push(source);\n    dist[source] = 0;\n    while (!q.empty()) {\n        int cur = q.front(); q.pop();\n        in_queue[cur] = 0;\n        for (int idx = head[cur]; ~idx; idx = edges[idx].next) {\n            int v = edges[idx].dest;\n            if (edges[idx].capacity && dist[v] > dist[cur] + edges[idx].weight) {\n                dist[v] = dist[cur] + edges[idx].weight;\n                prev_edge[v] = idx;\n                if (!in_queue[v]) {\n                    q.push(v);\n                    in_queue[v] = 1;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    return dist[sink] < 1000000000;\n}\n\nvoid augment_path(int source, int sink) {\n    for (int node = sink; node != source; node = edges[prev_edge[node] ^ 1].dest) {\n        edges[prev_edge[node]].capacity--;\n        edges[prev_edge[node] ^ 1].capacity++;\n    }\n    total_cost += dist[sink];\n}\n\nint main() {\n    memset(head, -1, sizeof(head));\n    scanf(\"%d %d %d %d %d\", &n, &m, &k, &c, &d);\n    int source = 0, sink = 6000;\n    for (int i = 1; i <= k; i++) {\n        scanf(\"%d\", &arrival_times[i]);\n        insert_edge(source, encode(0, arrival_times[i]), 1, 0);\n    }\n    for (int i = 1; i <= m; i++) {\n        scanf(\"%d %d\", &from_node[i], &to_node[i]);\n    }\n    for (int t = 0; t <= 100; t++) {\n        for (int i = 2; i <= n; i++) {\n            insert_edge(encode(t, i), encode(t + 1, i), k, c);\n        }\n        insert_edge(encode(t, 1), sink, k, 0);\n        for (int i = 1; i <= m; i++) {\n            for (int j = 1; j <= min(k, 25); j++) {\n                insert_edge(encode(t, from_node[i]), encode(t + 1, to_node[i]), 1, c + (2 * j - 1) * d);\n                insert_edge(encode(t, to_node[i]), encode(t + 1, from_node[i]), 1, c + (2 * j - 1) * d);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    while (find_shortest_path(source, sink)) augment_path(source, sink);\n    printf(\"%d\\n\", total_cost);\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static final int MAX_NODES = 6010;\n    static final int INF = 0x3f3f3f3f;\n    static int n, m, k, c, d, edge_count, total_cost;\n    static int[] arrival_times = new int[6010];\n    static int[] from_node = new int[6010];\n    static int[] to_node = new int[6010];\n    static int[] head = new int[6010];\n    static int[] prev_edge = new int[2000010];\n    static int[] dist = new int[6010];\n    static int[] in_queue = new int[6010];\n    static Queue<Integer> q = new LinkedList<>();\n    \n    static class Edge {\n        int dest, capacity, weight, next;\n        Edge(int dest, int capacity, int weight, int next) {\n            this.dest = dest;\n            this.capacity = capacity;\n            this.weight = weight;\n            this.next = next;\n        }\n    }\n    \n    static Edge[] edges = new Edge[2000010];\n    \n    static int encode(int time, int vertex) {\n        return time * n + vertex;\n    }\n    \n    static void insert_edge(int src, int dst, int cap, int cost) {\n        edges[edge_count] = new Edge(dst, cap, cost, head[src]);\n        head[src] = edge_count++;\n        edges[edge_count] = new Edge(src, 0, -cost, head[dst]);\n        head[dst] = edge_count++;\n    }\n    \n    static boolean find_shortest_path(int source, int sink) {\n        Arrays.fill(dist, INF);\n        q.clear();\n        q.push(source);\n        dist[source] = 0;\n        while (!q.isEmpty()) {\n            int cur = q.poll();\n            in_queue[cur] = 0;\n            for (int idx = head[cur]; idx != -1; idx = edges[idx].next) {\n                int v = edges[idx].dest;\n                if (edges[idx].capacity > 0 && dist[v] > dist[cur] + edges[idx].weight) {\n                    dist[v] = dist[cur] + edges[idx].weight;\n                    prev_edge[v] = idx;\n                    if (in_queue[v] == 0) {\n                        q.push(v);\n                        in_queue[v] = 1;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        return dist[sink] < 1000000000;\n    }\n    \n    static void augment_path(int source, int sink) {\n        for (int node = sink; node != source; node = edges[prev_edge[node] ^ 1].dest) {\n            edges[prev_edge[node]].capacity--;\n            edges[prev_edge[node] ^ 1].capacity++;\n        }\n        total_cost += dist[sink];\n    }\n    \n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        n = sc.nextInt();\n        m = sc.nextInt();\n        k = sc.nextInt();\n        c = sc.nextInt();\n        d = sc.nextInt();\n        \n        Arrays.fill(head, -1);\n        edge_count = 0;\n        total_cost = 0;\n        \n        int source = 0;\n        int sink = 6000;\n        \n        for (int i = 1; i <= k; i++) {\n            arrival_times[i] = sc.nextInt();\n            insert_edge(source, encode(0, arrival_times[i]), 1, 0);\n        }\n        \n        for (int i = 1; i <= m; i++) {\n            from_node[i] = sc.nextInt();\n            to_node[i] = sc.nextInt();\n        }\n        \n        for (int t = 0; t <= 100; t++) {\n            for (int i = 2; i <= n; i++) {\n                insert_edge(encode(t, i), encode(t + 1, i), k, c);\n            }\n            insert_edge(encode(t, 1), sink, k, 0);\n            for (int i = 1; i <= m; i++) {\n                for (int j = 1; j <= Math.min(k, 25); j++) {\n                    insert_edge(encode(t, from_node[i]), encode(t + 1, to_node[i]), 1, c + (2 * j - 1) * d);\n                    insert_edge(encode(t, to_node[i]), encode(t + 1, from_node[i]), 1, c + (2 * j - 1) * d);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        \n        while (find_shortest_path(source, sink)) {\n            augment_path(source, sink);\n        }\n        \n        System.out.println(total_cost);\n        sc.close();\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-8.320462075062096e-05, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, -0.0012518672738224268, -3.266281055402942e-05, -0.005234820768237114, -0.01828012987971306, -4.6491513785440475e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -5.6622808187967166e-05, -0.0017028844449669123, -7.867782187531702e-06, -0.00622536102309823, -0.0001572246983